SUMMARY:Davis Musical Theatre Presents Mean Girls
DESCRIPTION:Davis Musical Theatre Presents Mean Girls \nCady Heron may have grown up on an African savanna\, but nothing prepared her for the wild and vicious ways of her strange new home: suburban Illinois. When Cady encounters The Plastics—a trio of powerful frenemies led by the charming but ruthless Regina George—she becomes caught in the school’s popularity hierarchy. Cady and her new friends devise a “Revenge Party” to end Regina’s reign\, but Cady soon learns that taking down a queen bee can come at a cost—and that losing yourself is far more dangerous than losing a popularity contest. \n*Mean Girls contains mature themes and language*
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/davis-musical-theatre-presents-mean-girls/2026-11-06/
LOCATION:Davis Musical Theatre Company (DMTC)\, The Jean Henderson Performing Arts Center\, 607 Pena Drive\, Davis
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/mean-girls.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Davis Musical Theatre Company (DMTC)":MAILTO:info@dmtc.org
END:VEVENT
