SUMMARY:Davis Musical Theatre Presents The Lion King Jr
DESCRIPTION:Davis Musical Theatre Company Presents: Disney’s The Lion King Jr. \nIn the Pride Lands of the African savanna\, an adventurous lion cub named Simba is destined to succeed his father\, Mufasa\, as king. When Simba’s jealous uncle Scar causes Mufasa’s death\, he manipulates Simba into believing he is responsible. Overcome with guilt\, Simba flees his home\, leaving Scar to seize control of the kingdom. \nYears later\, Simba must confront his past and decide whether he is ready to accept his identity\, return to the Pride Lands\, and fulfill his responsibilities. Featuring beloved songs including “Circle of Life\,” “I Just Can’t Wait to Be King\,” “Hakuna Matata\,” and “Can You Feel the Love Tonight\,” Disney’s The Lion King JR. is a vibrant story of family\, courage\, identity\, and discovering one’s place in the world. \nRecommended for audiences of all ages.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/disneys-the-lion-king-jr/2026-11-14/
LOCATION:Davis Musical Theatre Company (DMTC)\, The Jean Henderson Performing Arts Center\, 607 Pena Drive\, Davis
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Lion-King.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Davis Musical Theatre Company (DMTC)":MAILTO:info@dmtc.org
END:VEVENT
